204507078931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lsbeR1hfz1cQ7kNvwHlNbmy&_nc_oc=AdpwhhTnVGqKjEwO0zJW6BVimSATKSAC65kkWM0LQwceNpHqKOLJ9LAzig5eRAf6az8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfykB002l_r2j-7un9ZAd-dzncavyf9WzM1McCSpcnYf0Q&oe=69C1340A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "historyExperienceAlhambra_Miniatura.png", "id": "4447495258804677", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823271_4447495262138010_5210715695571631444_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wA6-FROFTh0Q7kNvwErgz1g&_nc_oc=AdrxGP94ZR-KCoeiVrL1bCQHAVAuRL9JRTDNgUV4DrOQJre2g5CPMYBRT_ztsfX6L-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwIQ1uRuazBvIBuQ0TzHrAqUte5bngZ9di7RliRakKllg&oe=69C151A4"}, "display_name": "History Experience: Alhambra", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the Alhambra as if you were truly there.\n\nThis virtual reality experience allows you to explore the historic Alhambra with an astonishing level of detail and realism. Thanks to cutting-edge graphics, every room, courtyard, and corridor has been faithfully recreated\u2014from the Nasrid architecture to the monument\u2019s unique atmosphere.\n\nThe app offers two experience modes to suit all types of users:\n\n\ud83d\udd39 Tour Mode\nExplore the Alhambra following a carefully designed route. As you move forward, explanatory audio guides accompany you, narrating the history, art, and purpose of each space. This mode turns the visit into an educational and immersive experience, perfect for learning while being fully absorbed in the journey.\n\n\ud83d\udd39 Free Mode\nExplore without limits. Move freely through the environments, stop wherever you like, and discover every corner at your own pace. This mode is designed for those who want to enjoy the surroundings, observe architectural details, or simply lose themselves in the beauty of the place.\n\nWhether used as an educational tool, a cultural visit, or an immersive experience, this app transforms the Alhambra into an interactive journey through time, accessible from anywhere in the world.\n\nA unique way to discover one of history\u2019s most iconic monuments, combining technology, culture, and emotion in an unforgettable VR experience.", "short_description": "Explore the historic Alhambra in virtual reality. Move freely through its rooms and settings while explanatory audio guides lead you through the history, art, and secrets of each space. An immersive, educational, and unique experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "historyExperienceAlhambra_MiniaturaVertical.png", "id": "4424325784469109", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825481_4424325787802442_8692354091969132994_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vHXneL5VfUYQ7kNvwH1n934&_nc_oc=AdoC2b4U6n1zcoLRujnOPTvC89k94ttRZaz9bK91OmZdasMqtw1R8DwmgbVrVl4UL4Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwfGSFzHbzkO8dvqipc2oQ8LoyyBB17N1jsonWqasK7Lw&oe=69C14290"}, {"file_name": "historyExperienceAlhambra_MiniaturaCuadrado.png", "id": "2636462033413898", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825503_2636462036747231_897844966885639506_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VUPtF9qnFEwQ7kNvwEoYWIY&_nc_oc=Adrp8L6Rw8esQ8tARcnyaNW4xKxRTFN28WTUJRFgEhzTEhxR6hBF-Tpo0Kw-ImZbli8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwUSzeBTvVhGJtGtDM_QTMN_Q6KJdJthdfirq3xQB0frA&oe=69C1231E"}, {"file_name": "historyExperienceAlhambra_Logotipo.png", "id": "1611127823637353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1611127826970686_5502602208638965298_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4W9kc3ueQtMQ7kNvwEHusES&_nc_oc=AdrAGCdx28XsbL1Pe6Usa6nRsJaU9hEfHJ-q1l9GEcGIjzm2UWIS9w1PRi9WteNCkJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=sco